# ============================================================================
# MTQΣ Koyeb Keeper — environment variables
# ============================================================================
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit `.env` to git.
#
# 🔴 HOT WALLET — low-privilege, rotate regularly.
#   Can only submit weight vectors. Cannot mint/redeem/pause.
#   Fund this address with testnet-native gas only (e.g. 0.05 MON on Monad
#   testnet, free from a faucet). Do NOT fund it with USDC or MTQ.
# ============================================================================

# 🔴 KEEPER HOT WALLET PRIVATE KEY — low-privilege, rotate regularly.
#   This key holds ONLY the KEEPER_ROLE on the MTQSigmaV2 contract. It can
#   call advanceIndex / commitWeights / submitTargetWeights / executeRebalance
#   / setCrisisFlag / updateState. It CANNOT mint, redeem, pause, change
#   governance, or touch the constitutional envelopes.
#   Generate with: bun -e "const {Wallet}=require('ethers'); console.log(new Wallet(ethers.randomBytes(32)).privateKey)"
KEEPER_PRIVATE_KEY=0xyour_keeper_hot_wallet_private_key
KEEPER_ADDRESS=0xyour_keeper_hot_wallet_address

# RPC endpoint for the chain where MTQSigmaV2 is deployed.
# Testnet examples (all free, no key):
#   Monad Testnet:    https://testnet-rpc.monadvision.com
#   Arc Testnet:      https://rpc.testnet.arc.io
#   Robinhood Testnet:https://rpc.testnet.chain.robinhood.com/rpc
RPC_URL=https://...testnet.rpc.url

# MTQSigmaV2 contract address on the chain above. Once the protocol owner
# runs scripts/deploy.ts, this address is recorded in
# contracts/deployments/<chain>.json.
CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x...

# Turso (libSQL) — audit trail. Free tier, no card.
# Create at https://turso.tech → create database → create token.
# The keeper creates the `keeper_audit` table lazily on first tick.
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://...
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=...

# Upstash Redis (OPTIONAL) — distributed lock so two keeper instances
# (e.g. during a Koyeb blue-green deploy) don't both submit the same tx.
# Free tier, no card. If unset, the keeper runs in single-instance mode
# (which is fine for a single Koyeb service).
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Discord webhook (OPTIONAL) — critical alerts. Free, no card.
# Create: Discord server → channel settings → Integrations → Webhooks.
# Alerts are rate-limited to 1 per 5 minutes per topic to avoid spam.
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=
